    "Build applications with the Gemini Interactions API and Live API, including text, image, video, and speech generation, managed agents, and real-time multimodal streaming.": "使用 Gemini Interactions API 与 Live API 构建应用，涵盖文本、图像、视频与语音生成、托管智能体及实时多模态流。",
    "Keep your coding agent up to date with the latest web best practices.": "让你的编程智能体始终掌握最新的现代 Web 开发最佳实践。",
    "Let the running agent actively select, pin, and organize critical context across Antigravity context compression with automatic post-compaction recovery.": "让运行中的智能体主动筛选、固定与整理关键上下文锚点，并在 Antigravity 上下文压缩后自动恢复。",
    "Unlock the power of agent swarms.": "解锁多智能体蜂群协作能力。",

    "Comprehensive guide and reference for the Antigravity Customization System. Use to explain how customizations work, their loading priority, discovery mechanisms, and to guide the creation of skills, rules, plugins, hooks, and MCP servers.": "Antigravity 自定义系统的完整参考指南。用于说明各类自定义扩展的工作原理、加载优先级与发现机制，并指导创建技能（Skills）、规则（Rules）、插件（Plugins）、钩子（Hooks）和 MCP 服务。",
    "Provides a comprehensive guide, quick reference, and sitemap for Google Antigravity (AGY), including the Antigravity CLI (agy), Antigravity 2.0, Antigravity IDE, Python SDK, slash commands, keybindings, and customizations (skills, rules, MCP, sidecars). Activate this skill when the user asks questions about how to use, configure, or customize Antigravity, AGY, the agy CLI, the Antigravity IDE, or Antigravity 2.0.": "提供 Google Antigravity（AGY）的完整指南、速查参考与文档索引，涵盖命令行工具（agy）、Antigravity 2.0、Antigravity IDE、Python SDK、斜杠指令、快捷键及自定义配置（技能、规则、MCP、Sidecar）。当用户询问如何使用、配置或定制 Antigravity 时激活。",
    "Interactive guide to design and create a scheduled background automation. Use this skill when the user wants to create an automated or recurring scheduled task (e.g. \"summarize my emails every morning\", \"every Monday send me a to-do list\"). Also triggered by the /automation slash command.": "用于设计与创建后台定时自动化任务的交互式指南。当用户希望设置定时或周期性任务（如“每天早上总结邮件”、“每周一发送待办清单”）或输入 /automation 指令时启用。",
    "How to render rich interactive HTML widgets inline in the chat or as standalone artifacts. Use this skill when you want to show the user diagrams, data visualizations, interactive controls, educational walkthroughs, or any rich visual content beyond plain text and markdown.": "说明如何在对话流内嵌或作为独立产物渲染富交互 HTML 微件。适用于向用户展示图表、数据可视化、交互控件、教学演示或超越纯文本与 Markdown 的富媒体内容。",
    "Build, package, and debug MCP Apps for Antigravity: MCP server tools whose results render as interactive UI in the conversation, in the side pane, or full-page from the sidebar. Use when adding a UI to an MCP tool, building or theming the app itself, packaging it as a plugin, or debugging an app that doesn't render or behave as expected.": "用于构建、打包和调试 Antigravity 的 MCP 应用：使 MCP 工具结果以交互式界面形式渲染在对话流、右侧辅助栏或全屏视图中。适用于为 MCP 工具添加界面、主题适配、打包成插件或排查渲染与交互异常。",
    "Migrates the user's MCP servers, skills, slash commands, subagents, and instruction files from other coding agents (Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI) into one new Antigravity plugin. Use when the user wants to bring over, import, or migrate their setup or config from another agent or tool. Don't use for installing Marketplace plugins or authoring a new plugin from scratch (use the plugin skill).": "将用户在其他 AI 编程工具（Claude Code、Codex、Cursor、Gemini CLI）中的 MCP 服务、技能、斜杠指令、子智能体与指令文件迁移整合为一个新的 Antigravity 插件。注意：不适用于从应用市场安装插件或从零编写新插件。",
    "Automatically migrate legacy workflows to modern skills across global and workspace configurations. Scans for existing workflows, creates target SKILL.md files, and safely archives old workflow files.": "自动将全局与工作区配置中的旧版工作流（Workflows）迁移为现代技能（Skills）。自动扫描旧工作流、生成目标 SKILL.md 并安全归档原文件。",
    "(Preview & Quota Heavy) Run a swarm: several agents working in parallel on one task, each in its own conversation, collaborating through a shared message board. Use when the work splits into pieces that can be done at the same time, or when a second pair of eyes should check the first pair's work.": "（预览特性 · 额度消耗较高）运行蜂群协作（Swarm）：多个智能体各自在独立对话中并行处理同一任务，通过共享消息板协同。适用于可并行拆分的复杂任务或需要交叉复核的场景。",
    "Guidelines for interacting with GitHub and request permissions from the user when commands fail due to restrictions in the agent environment.": "与 GitHub 交互的规范指南，并在代理环境受限导致命令失败时向用户请求相应权限。",
    "How to manage and create plugins — namespaced bundles of skills, agents, rules, MCP servers and hooks that install, enable and disable as a single unit. Use this skill when the user wants to enable, disable, install or uninstall a plugin, when they want to create a new plugin, or when a new customization should be packaged into a plugin rather than left loose. Also triggered by the /plugin slash command. Don't use for the underlying customization system itself — discovery roots, loading priority, or authoring a standalone skill, agent, rule, hook or MCP server outside a plugin; see the customizations guide skill for those.": "说明如何管理与创建插件（Plugins）——将技能、智能体、规则、MCP 服务与钩子打包为带命名空间的单一单元进行整体安装、启用或停用。支持 /plugin 指令触发；若仅编写独立技能或了解底层发现优先级，请查阅自定义系统指南。",
    "How to write and run a dynamic workflow script with the `run_workflow` tool: a Python script that orchestrates many agents with `agent`, `parallel`, `pipeline`, and `phase`. Use when a task splits into many independent or staged pieces of agent work (fan out over files, modules, bugs, or review angles, then aggregate), or when the user asks for a workflow. Don't use for a single delegated task (use a subagent) or for legacy workflow files (see migrate-workflows).": "说明如何使用 `run_workflow` 工具编写和运行动态 Python 编排脚本，通过 `agent`、`parallel`、`pipeline` 与 `phase` 调度多智能体协作。适用于需要按文件、模块或审查维度并发扇出再汇总的任务。",
    "ONLY for the native-swarm worker whose brief says it is the monitor. On a timer, it checks whether the whole swarm has stalled and calls on the one member who can unstick it. Coordinators and other workers: do not load this.": "仅供蜂群（Swarm）中明确指定为监控员的工作节点使用。定时检查整个蜂群是否停滞并唤醒可推进卡点的成员；协调者与其他工作节点请勿加载。",
    "ONLY for the native-swarm worker whose brief says it is the narrator. It watches the board and keeps the facts behind the user's Overview (view.json) current. Coordinators and other workers: do not load this.": "仅供蜂群（Swarm）中明确指定为纪要员的工作节点使用。持续关注共享消息板并同步更新用户的概览视图（view.json）；协调者与其他工作节点请勿加载。",
    "Discover UI plugin panels relevant to the current task and surface a one-click pill in chat to open (toggle) them in the side pane. Use when a running UI plugin's panel would help with what the user is doing, or right after the user enables a new UI plugin pane and a shortcut to open it is handy.": "发现与当前任务相关的 UI 插件面板，并在对话中提供一键打开/切换右侧辅助面板的快捷胶囊按钮。",

    "Let the running agent actively inspect, select, consolidate, and prune critical context anchors so key decisions, constraints, file pointers, and task state survive Antigravity context compression. Use when the user invokes /context-anchor or asks to save, review, clean up, or restore important context.": "让运行中的智能体主动检查、筛选、合并与清理关键上下文锚点（Context Anchors），确保核心决策、约束条件、文件路径指针与任务状态在 Antigravity 上下文压缩后依然完整保留。调用 /context-anchor 或请求保存/恢复上下文时触发。",

    "Search tool for modern web development best practices. MANDATORY: Execute FIRST for all HTML/CSS and clientside JS tasks. Do NOT skip — web APIs evolve rapidly and training weights contain obsolete patterns. Trigger immediately for: modals/dialogs/popovers, tables, dark mode, anchor positioning, container queries, view transitions, scroll-driven animations, parallax/reveals, forms, validation, autofill, accessibility, custom selects, scrollbars, CWV (LCP, INP, CLS), content-visibility, fetch priority, image optimization, security, passkeys, HTML sanitization, web components, dates/timezones, built-in AI, WebAssembly, standard HTML/CSS/DOM in frameworks, etc. DO NOT trigger for: backend (SQL, ORMs, API routes), infra/scripts (CI/CD, Docker, Actions, Python/Go, Git), or tooling/trivial (Vite, tsconfig, ESLint, tests, copy/renames, 3P docs), etc.": "现代 Web 开发最佳实践检索工具。凡涉及前端 HTML/CSS 与客户端 JS 任务（如弹窗、表格、深色模式、无障碍、表单、滚动条、性能优化、Web 安全等）必须优先调用；纯后端 SQL/API 或 CI 脚本类任务无需触发。",
    "Build and publish Chrome Extensions using Manifest V3 best practices. Use this skill whenever the user asks to create, modify, debug, or understand Chrome browser extensions, add-ons, or anything involving the Chrome Extensions API. Trigger on mentions of: 'Chrome extension', 'browser extension', 'manifest.json', 'content script', 'service worker' (in browser context), 'popup' (in browser extension context), 'side panel', 'chrome.* API', 'declarativeNetRequest', 'omnibox', 'context menu' (in extension context), 'userScripts', 'user script', 'script manager', or any request to build functionality that integrates with the Chrome browser UI. Also trigger for publishing to the Chrome Web Store: 'publish extension', preparing an extension for publishing, responding to a review rejection, writing permission justifications, or drafting a privacy policy.": "基于 Manifest V3 最佳实践开发与发布 Chrome 浏览器扩展。涵盖 manifest.json、content script、service worker、侧边栏、chrome.* API 及 Chrome 网上应用店审核发布规范。",

    "Use this skill when writing code that calls the Gemini API for text generation, multi-turn chat, multimodal understanding, image generation, video generation, speech generation (TTS), voice design, voice replication, streaming responses, background research tasks, function calling, structured output, or migrating from the old generateContent API. Covers SDK usage and best practices for Gemini models and agents in Python and TypeScript.": "在编写调用 Gemini API 的代码（文本生成、多轮对话、多模态理解、生图/生视频、TTS 语音合成、流式响应、函数调用、结构化输出或从旧版迁移）时使用，涵盖 Python 与 TypeScript 官方 SDK 最佳实践。",
    "Use this skill when building real-time, bidirectional streaming applications with the Gemini Live API, or migrating legacy Live models (2.0/2.5/3.1) to Gemini 3.8 Live. Covers WebSocket-based audio/video/text streaming, voice activity detection (VAD), background reasoning (extended thinking), asynchronous function calling, session management, ephemeral tokens, live transcription, and live translation. SDKs covered - google-genai (Python), @google/genai (JavaScript/TypeScript).": "用于基于 Gemini Live API 构建实时双向流式音视频/文本应用（含 WebSocket 流、语音端点检测 VAD、扩展思考、异步函数调用、实时转录与翻译），涵盖 Python 与 JS/TS SDK。",
    "Use this skill for generative video editing, text-to-video, image- and video-referenced video generation, first-frame-to-video, first-and-last-frame transitions, and video extensions using Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash (gemini-omni-1.2-flash) via the official google-genai SDK. Includes workflows for pre-processing/optimizing high-resolution or long source videos with ffmpeg, stripping audio for full sound regeneration, and handling turn-by-turn video editing and parallel execution.": "用于通过官方 google-genai SDK 调用 Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash 进行生成式视频编辑、文生视频、首尾帧过渡与视频延展，包含 ffmpeg 预处理及分轮并行视频工作流。",

    "Compress and pack codebase directories or files into a compact, token-optimized context format using Repomix CLI. Use this skill whenever you or the user need to inspect, understand, or feed a multi-file project or large directory into the context window without exceeding token limits or reading files individually.": "使用 Repomix CLI 将代码库目录或文件压缩打包为紧凑、省 Token 的上下文格式，适合在不爆上下文且无需逐个读文件的情况下整体分析大型项目。",
    "Audits what a running game's screen shows at the moments that matter, by capturing frames at gameplay events and at forced coincidences and checking them for overlapping or occluded text, indicators too faint, too small, or too brief to read, HUD elements whose meaning an isolated reader cannot name, and labels no decision depends on. Use when a game plays correctly but a display may be hidden, clipped, crowded, unexplained, or unnecessary, after adding HUD elements, notices, warnings, or score popups, or before release. Not for whether the goal, options, and risk can be read (use gating-intent-legibility), for choosing a visual direction (use directing-game-visuals), or for font selection and licensing (use styling-web-game-typography).": "审计运行中游戏画面在关键时刻的可读性：截取事件帧检查文字遮挡重叠、指示器过暗/过小/过短、含义不明的 HUD 元素以及冗余标签。适合新增 HUD、提示或发布前自查。",
    "Builds and tunes game cameras, engine-neutral with Godot and Cinemachine 3 mappings: 2D follow with deadzone and look-ahead, third-person orbit, first-person look and split-screen. Use when the camera lags, jitters while following, shows past the level edge, clips through walls or changes with frame rate. Not for shake (`game-feel`) or physics timestep jitter (`physics-tuning`).": "设计与调校游戏相机系统（提供引擎无关原理及 Godot / Cinemachine 3 映射）：包含 2D 死区跟随与前瞻、第三人称轨道、第一人称视角及分屏。用于解决镜头滞后、抖动、穿墙或帧率依赖问题。",
    "Design, implement, tune, or test readable tactical action combat for web games. Use for attack timing, guard and dodge windows, hit contact, posture, lock-on, weapons, boss phases, combat feedback, and deterministic combat tests.": "设计、实现、调优或测试可读性强的 Web 游戏战术动作战斗系统，涵盖攻击前摇/判定窗口、格挡闪避、命中接触、架势值、锁定、Boss 阶段与确定性战斗测试。",
    "Directs readable, coherent game visuals. Use when defining visual hierarchy, palette roles, screen composition, event feedback, or reducing generic AI-looking game art without relying on HUD text.": "指导构建清晰统一的游戏视觉表达，用于确立视觉层级、配色职责、画面构图与事件反馈，减少廉价 AI 美术感而不依赖堆砌 HUD 文字。",
    "Use when implementing game animations, player feedback, character movement, anticipation, smear arcs, follow-through, squash and stretch, or interactive combat animation.": "用于实现游戏动画与玩家动作反馈，包括预备动作、残影弧线、跟随动作、挤压拉伸及交互式战斗动画。",
    "Build, fix and review character combat animations (melee strikes, bow shots, spell casts, skills, monster attacks, whole move sets) so they read like Diablo IV, Baldur's Gate 3 or Elden Ring and never stretch, lock, wring or break an arm, wrist or hand. A written standard with numbered rules, per-frame tests on the real skinned mesh, keys designed from upper-arm, forearm and blade intents, checks from every camera the player sees, two blind critics plus a blind A/B against the last release, and every critic claim verified against full-resolution frames and live-rig numbers. Use when creating or reworking any attack, skill or move set; when the user says arms, hands, wrists, elbows or weapons look stretched, weird, broken or wrong; when they ask for a standard, rules or tests for animations; or when they ask to score animations or get them to N out of 10.": "构建、修复与评审角色战斗动画（近战、弓箭、施法与怪物招式），确保动作质感对标主流动作 RPG 且绝不出现手臂/手腕拉伸扭曲穿模，配套逐帧蒙皮检测与双盲对比标准。",
    "Score a game's combat skills and spells out of 10 with blind judges, then raise the weakest to a bar, for timing and readability (does a skill read as itself, does the blow land when it lands) and for art (detail, light, trails, impact, art direction, judged against a reference such as Diablo IV). Covers filming casts on a stopped, stepped clock, contact strips and close-ups, anonymised two-judge rounds, the levers that moved scores (hero props made from a painted concept with image-to-3D, own schedules and keyed moves, painted additive textures, camera-facing ribbons, light outside the body), the traps that cost points, asset and load budgets, and shipping each skill as its own version. Use when the user asks to score, review, improve, polish or rebuild combat skills, spells or attacks; says a skill \"doesn't make sense\", \"looks bad\" or should look like another game; names a target score; or starts a \"next skill\" thread. Project specifics (review hooks, harness settings, where each skill's code lives, scores so far) go in an optional local references/<project>.md next to this skill.": "通过双盲评审为战斗技能与法术的打击节奏、辨识度及美术表现进行 10 分制打分与打磨迭代，涵盖定帧切片拍摄、道具与光效调优及资源预算控制。",
    "Adds engine-neutral juice to a working mechanic: trauma-based screen shake, hit-stop, eased tweens, squash and stretch, and knockback. Use when the game feels flat, weightless or not punchy, or hits and jumps should feel satisfying. Not for coyote time (`platformer`), input buffering (`input-systems`), camera follow (`camera-systems`) or HUD layout (`game-ui-ux`).": "为已有玩法机制增添引擎无关的手感润色（Juice）：包含创伤度震屏、顿帧（Hit-stop）、缓动补间、挤压拉伸与击退反馈。",
    "Use when tuning 2D controls, jumps, input buffering, hit stop, recoil, camera shake, particles, telegraphs, or moment-to-moment feedback. Do not use to change gameplay rules, UI accessibility, performance budgets, or tests.": "用于调优 2D 游戏操控与即时反馈，包括跳跃手感、输入缓冲、顿帧、后坐力、震屏、粒子与出招预警（不用于修改核心规则或性能预算）。",
    "Engine-neutral input architecture: named actions, stick deadzones, buffered presses and rebinding with conflict checks. Use for controller support, rebind menus, action buffering, or dropped presses.": "引擎无关的游戏输入架构设计：具名动作映射、摇杆死区、输入缓冲及带冲突检测的改键菜单，适合手柄支持与防吞键优化。",
    "Improves the tactile satisfaction (\"game feel\") of action games whose visuals are functional but flat. Use when a game runs correctly but feels lifeless; applies to players, enemies, obstacles, projectiles, and items.": "提升动作游戏的打击感与交互满足感（Game Feel），适用于逻辑正常但反馈平淡的角色、敌人、障碍物、弹道与道具调优。",
    "Engine-neutral physics tuning: fixed timestep and interpolation, CCD against tunnelling, damping, solver iterations and collision layer matrices. Use when bodies jitter, fast objects pass through walls or motion feels floaty or frame-rate dependent.": "引擎无关的物理参数调校：固定时间步长与插值、防高速穿模的连续碰撞检测（CCD）、阻尼、求解器迭代次数与碰撞层矩阵。",

